//! The `mask-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the
//! initial position, relative to the mask position layer set by `mask-origin`, for each defined mask
//! image.
//!
//! Initial: 0% 0%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to size of mask painting area minus size of mask layer image (see the text for
//! `background-position`).
//!
//! Grammar: <position>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-masking-1/#propdef-mask-position
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/mask-position
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

